#: globalPlugins/nvdaCoach/__init__.py:635
msgid "Before you begin, there is one key you should know right now. The Control key, labeled Ctrl, is in the bottom-left corner of your keyboard. Press it once and NVDA stops talking immediately, no matter what it is reading. This is the single most useful key you will ever learn as an NVDA user. You will reach for it dozens of times every day, in every program, at any moment.\n\nNVDA Coach teaches screen reader commands through short, hands-on practice sessions. Each lesson guides you through one command at a time and waits for you to try it before moving on. The program is designed for beginners who already have a basic feel for their keyboard, including letters, numbers, arrow keys, Enter, Escape, and Tab.\n\nIf you are not yet confident with your keyboard, that is completely fine. NVDA has a built-in tool called Input Help. Press NVDA and the number 1 together to turn it on. While Input Help is active, pressing any key tells you what that key does without actually doing it. Press NVDA+1 again to turn it off. You can use Input Help at any time, even during a lesson.\n\n"
msgstr "在开始之前，有一个键你现在就应该知道。Control 键（标注为 Ctrl）位于键盘的左下角。按一下它，无论 NVDA 正在读什么，它都会立即停止说话。这是作为 NVDA 用户你将学到的最有用的一个键。你每天都会用到它几十次，在任何程序里、任何时刻。\n\nNVDA Coach 通过简短的实践练习来教你屏幕阅读器命令。每节课一次只带你练习一个命令，并会等你亲自试过之后再继续。本程序专为已经对键盘有基本了解的初学者设计，包括字母、数字、光标键、回车键、Escape 和 Tab。\n\n如果你对键盘还不太有把握，那也完全没关系。NVDA 有一个内置工具，叫做输入帮助。同时按下 NVDA 键和数字 1 即可开启它。输入帮助开启时，按任意键都会告诉你这个键的作用，而不会真的执行它。再按一次 NVDA+1 即可关闭。你可以随时使用输入帮助，即使在课程进行中也可以。\n\n"

#: globalPlugins/nvdaCoach/__init__.py:652
msgid "--- KEYS AVAILABLE DURING EVERY LESSON ---\nThese function keys work at any time while a lesson is open:\n\n  Enter  —  Confirm you have tried the step and move to the next one.\n  F1  —  Repeat the current instruction. Use this whenever you want NVDA to read the step again.\n  F2  —  Hear a hint. If you are not sure what to do, press F2 for a helpful suggestion. Press it again for additional hints.\n  F3  —  Skip the current step and move on. Use this if you cannot complete a step right now and want to continue.\n  Escape  —  Stop the lesson. Press Escape three times to close NVDA Coach.\n\n--- KEYS AVAILABLE ANY TIME IN THIS WINDOW ---\nThese keys work whether a lesson is running or not:\n\n  F4  —  Open the NVDA Coach help documentation in your web browser. Press F4 once to arm it, then press F4 again within five seconds to open.\n  F5  —  Send feedback to the developer by email. Press F5 once to arm it, then press F5 again within five seconds to open.\n  F6  —  Toggle lesson sounds on or off. Press once to silence sounds, press again to restore them.\n  F7  —  Open your profile. Set your name, your instructor's name, and your training center. This information personalizes your lessons and appears on your certificate of completion.\n\n--- LESSON NAVIGATION ---\n  Ctrl+N  —  Move to the next lesson in the current chapter.\n  Ctrl+B  —  Go back to the previous lesson.\n  Ctrl+R  —  Restart the current lesson from the beginning.\n\n"
msgstr "--- 每节课中随时可用的按键 ---\n课程打开期间，以下功能键随时可用：\n\n  回车键  ——  确认你已试过这一步，并进入下一步。\n  F1  ——  重复当前指令。任何时候想让 NVDA 再读一遍这一步，都可以用它。\n  F2  ——  听一条提示。如果你不确定该做什么，按 F2 会给你一条有用的建议。再按一次可获得更多提示。\n  F3  ——  跳过当前步骤，继续往下。如果这一步你现在无法完成、又想继续，可以用它。\n  Escape  ——  停止课程。连按三次 Escape 可关闭 NVDA Coach。\n\n--- 在本窗口中随时可用的按键 ---\n无论课程是否正在进行，以下按键都可用：\n\n  F4  ——  在网页浏览器中打开 NVDA Coach 帮助文档。先按一次 F4 预备，再在五秒内按一次 F4 打开。\n  F5  ——  通过电子邮件向开发者发送反馈。先按一次 F5 预备，再在五秒内按一次 F5 打开。\n  F6  ——  开启或关闭课程声音。按一次静音，再按一次恢复。\n  F7  ——  打开你的个人资料。设置你的姓名、讲师姓名和培训中心。这些信息会让你的课程更个性化，并显示在你的结业证书上。\n\n--- 课程导航 ---\n  Ctrl+N  ——  移动到当前章节的下一课。\n  Ctrl+B  ——  返回上一课。\n  Ctrl+R  ——  从头重新开始当前这一课。\n\n"

#: globalPlugins/nvdaCoach/__init__.py:679
msgid "When you are ready to begin, press Tab to find the Start Course button below and press Enter or Space to start the first lesson. You can also press NVDA+Shift+C to open the lesson picker and choose any lesson directly."
msgstr "准备好开始时，按 Tab 找到下方的“开始课程”按钮，然后按回车键或空格键开始第一课。你也可以按 NVDA+Shift+C 打开课程选择器，直接选择任意一课。"

#: globalPlugins/nvdaCoach/__init__.py:710
msgid "Ready, {name}."
msgstr "准备就绪，{name}。"

#: globalPlugins/nvdaCoach/__init__.py:710
msgid "Ready."
msgstr "就绪。"

#: globalPlugins/nvdaCoach/__init__.py:718
msgid "--- WHAT TO DO NEXT ---\n  Press NVDA+Shift+C to open the lesson picker and choose a lesson.\n\n--- LESSON NAVIGATION ---\n  Ctrl+N  —  Move to the next lesson in this category.\n  Ctrl+B  —  Go back to the previous lesson.\n  Ctrl+R  —  Restart this lesson from the beginning.\n\nThe Control key (Ctrl) is in the bottom-left corner of your keyboard.\n\n--- NEW TO KEYBOARD NAVIGATION? ---\nUse NVDA Input Help: press NVDA+1 to turn it on, press any key to hear what it does without anything happening, then press NVDA+1 to turn it off.\n\n--- A NOTE FOR INSTRUCTORS AND STUDENTS ---\nIf an instructor is present, this is a great time to ask any questions before the next lesson. If you are working independently, keep going at your own pace. Every step forward counts.\n\n--- QUICK KEYS (available any time in this window) ---\n  F4 — Open help documentation\n  F5 — Send feedback to the developer\n  F6 — Toggle lesson sounds on or off\n  F7 — Set your name and instructor's name"
msgstr "--- 接下来做什么 ---\n  按 NVDA+Shift+C 打开课程选择器，选择一课。\n\n--- 课程导航 ---\n  Ctrl+N  ——  移动到本类别的下一课。\n  Ctrl+B  ——  返回上一课。\n  Ctrl+R  ——  从头重新开始这一课。\n\nControl 键（Ctrl）位于键盘的左下角。\n\n--- 刚接触键盘导航？ ---\n使用 NVDA 输入帮助：按 NVDA+1 开启，按任意键即可听到它的作用而不会真的执行，然后按 NVDA+1 关闭。\n\n--- 给讲师和学员的提示 ---\n如果有讲师在场，现在正是在下一课之前提问的好时机。如果你是独自学习，就按自己的节奏继续。每向前一步都算数。\n\n--- 快捷键（在本窗口中随时可用） ---\n  F4 —— 打开帮助文档\n  F5 —— 向开发者发送反馈\n  F6 —— 开启或关闭课程声音\n  F7 —— 设置你的姓名和讲师姓名"

#: globalPlugins/nvdaCoach/__init__.py:745
msgid "Congratulations, {name} — Browse Mode and Web Navigation Complete!"
msgstr "恭喜你，{name}——浏览模式与网页导航已完成！"

#: globalPlugins/nvdaCoach/__init__.py:747
msgid "Congratulations — Browse Mode and Web Navigation Complete!"
msgstr "恭喜你——浏览模式与网页导航已完成！"

#: globalPlugins/nvdaCoach/__init__.py:750
msgid "Congratulations, {name}! You have completed Browse Mode and Web Navigation, Chapter 4 of NVDA Coach. The practice page in your browser can now be closed. Press NVDA+Shift+C to continue to additional training resources."
msgstr "恭喜你，{name}！你已完成 NVDA Coach 的第 4 章“浏览模式与网页导航”。现在可以关闭浏览器中的练习页面了。按 NVDA+Shift+C 继续前往更多培训资源。"

