#: globalPlugins/nvdaCoach/__init__.py:835
msgid "--- WHAT YOU HAVE LEARNED ---\n  Chapter 1: Getting Started with NVDA\n  Chapter 2: Your Keyboard\n  Chapter 3: Reading Text\n  Chapter 4: Browse Mode and Web Navigation\n  Chapter 5: Object Navigation\n  Chapter 6: Customizing NVDA\n\n"
msgstr "--- 你已学到的内容 ---\n  第 1 章：NVDA 入门\n  第 2 章：认识你的键盘\n  第 3 章：阅读和浏览文本\n  第 4 章：浏览模式与网页导航\n  第 5 章：对象导航\n  第 6 章：自定义 NVDA\n\n"

#: globalPlugins/nvdaCoach/__init__.py:844
msgid "--- YOUR CERTIFICATE OF COMPLETION ---\nTab to the Export Certificate button below and press Enter.\nYour certificate will open in your web browser.\n\nTo save or print your certificate:\n  1. In your browser, press Ctrl+S to save the page, or press Ctrl+P to print it.\n  2. To print to PDF, choose 'Save as PDF' or 'Microsoft Print to PDF' as your printer.\n  3. A copy is also saved automatically to your Downloads folder."
msgstr "--- 你的结业证书 ---\n用 Tab 移动到下方的“导出证书”按钮，然后按回车键。\n你的证书将在网页浏览器中打开。\n\n要保存或打印你的证书：\n  1. 在浏览器中，按 Ctrl+S 保存页面，或按 Ctrl+P 打印。\n  2. 要打印为 PDF，请在打印机中选择“另存为 PDF”或“Microsoft Print to PDF”。\n  3. 系统也会自动在你的下载文件夹中保存一份副本。"

